From 445326bd78bc15acd0391fb4101b23098f11e91f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: leow149 <leow149@lucidmail.xyz>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 22:19:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 69/69] wifi: xradio: add debugfs with firmware counters and
 block-ack policy

Add /sys/kernel/debug/xradio/ with:
  ampdu_counters  firmware TX/RX A-MPDU statistics (clear on read)
  counters        firmware MAC counters (retries, ACK failures, FCS)
  block_ack       read back / write the firmware BA TID policy ("tx rx" hex)
  txstate         hw_bufs_used and per-AC host queue occupancy
  ampdu_len       write the firmware A-MPDU length limit (MIB 0x000a)

This is what exposed the zero TX block-ack mask and the lack of TX
aggregation.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JJfik1hpStPgtN7deJRwXG
Signed-off-by: leow149 <leow149@lucidmail.xyz>
